## ezArgEnum
* You can now print enumerations easily like this:
```
// Before:
ezStringBuilder sUsage;
ezReflectionUtils::EnumerationToString(ezGetStaticRTTI<ezTexConvUsage>(), m_Usage.GetValue(), sUsage, ezReflectionUtils::EnumConversionMode::ValueNameOnly);
